The console entry point now lives in [InsertionSortDemo.java](/Users/allenjiang/Documents/ACE-Sycophancy-Codebase-Dataset/_worktrees/035_insertion_sort/InsertionSortDemo.java), and I added [InsertionSortSelfTest.java](/Users/allenjiang/Documents/ACE-Sycophancy-Codebase-Dataset/_worktrees/035_insertion_sort/InsertionSortSelfTest.java) as a simple executable test harness covering full-array sorting, range sorting, non-mutating copies, sorted detection, and input validation.

Verified with `javac InsertionSort.java InsertionSortDemo.java InsertionSortSelfTest.java`, `java InsertionSortDemo`, and `java InsertionSortSelfTest`. The self-test passes.

